        <p source="#source-10107-10251"><seg source="#source-10107-10116">（五）</seg><seg source="#source-10119-10168">Henri Cordier,Notes pour servir a l'Histoire des </seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-32" snh:source-marker="E'" source="#source-10168-10170" corresp="#source-10116-10119 #source-10243-10246">É</hi><seg source="#source-10170-10208">tudes chinoises en Europe（Nouveaux M</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-63" snh:source-marker="e'" source="#source-10208-10210" corresp="#source-10116-10119 #source-10243-10246">é</hi><seg source="#source-10210-10243">langes Orientaux 1886 p.400以下</seg><seg source="#source-10246-10251">）</seg></p>
