        <p source="#source-23393-23532"><seg source="#source-23393-23402">（一）</seg><seg source="#source-23405-23437">Henri Cordier,Notes pour servir </seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-54" snh:source-marker="a`" source="#source-23437-23439" corresp="#source-23402-23405 #source-23481-23484">à</hi><seg source="#source-23439-23481"> l'Histoire des Etudes Chinoises en Europe</seg><seg source="#source-23484-23532">（Nouveaux Me'langes Orientaux 1886 p. 409）</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-23532-23615"><seg source="#source-23532-23615">（二）桑原博士西安府の大秦景教流行中國碑（藝文第壹號）</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-23615-23762"><seg source="#source-23615-23624">（三）</seg><seg source="#source-23627-23633">Abel R</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-63" snh:source-marker="e'" source="#source-23633-23635" corresp="#source-23624-23627 #source-23685-23688">é</hi><seg source="#source-23635-23651">musat,Nouveaux M</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-63" snh:source-marker="e'" source="#source-23651-23653" corresp="#source-23624-23627 #source-23685-23688">é</hi><seg source="#source-23653-23685">langes Asiatiques Tome I. p. 258</seg><note type="base-edition" source="#source-23688-23760">底本の本文にこの注釈場所を示す注釈番号なし</note></p>
        <p source="#source-23762-23874"><seg source="#source-23762-23771">（四）</seg><seg source="#source-23774-23798">Notice Historique sur l'</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-32" snh:source-marker="E'" source="#source-23798-23800" corresp="#source-23771-23774 #source-23826-23829">É</hi><seg source="#source-23800-23826">cole des Langues Orientale</seg><seg source="#source-23829-23832">（</seg><seg source="#source-23835-23836">M</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-63" snh:source-marker="e'" source="#source-23836-23838" corresp="#source-23832-23835 #source-23866-23869">é</hi><seg source="#source-23838-23866">langes Orientaux 1883 p. XL.</seg><seg source="#source-23869-23874">）</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-23874-23918"><seg source="#source-23874-23918">（五）通報（Jnillet 1913 Vol. XIV）</seg></p>
